cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "The World Is Not Enough: ELEKTRA — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic BOND suite mission software modeling six operational pillars:
  oil-pipeline choke-point security (max-flow/min-cut, betweenness, tamper
  simulation), submarine evasion and detection (passive-sonar detection and
  least-risk routing), Stockholm-syndrome influence dynamics (hostage ODE
  model), DC power-flow load solve with cascading blackout, hostage negotiation
  under syndrome-driven patience (Rubinstein bargaining), and Kalman-filter
  sensor fusion. All results are reproducible under a fixed seed.
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
    affiliation: "Active Inference Institute"
